WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.270
Pull a mass on a spring
aside, and let it go.

2
00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:08.280
It races through the middle, slows
down, and stops dead at the far end.

3
00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:11.860
Then it sets off back again,
as if nothing had happened.

4
00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:13.390
Stop, start.

5
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:15.420
Stop, start.

6
00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.720
At the instant it stops,
it isn't moving at all.

7
00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:20.920
So where is its energy?

8
00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:24.740
In this mission, you'll follow the
energy at every point of the motion,

9
00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:27.090
and graph it against displacement.

10
00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:29.940
Then you'll watch the same
energy change with time,

11
00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:31.770
through a full cycle.

12
00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:36.520
Your mission: find out where the energy
is at the instant the mass stops.
